            "review_text": "Kim1989UK\n109 contributions\n0\nGood food, slow service\nJan 2017 • Couples\nWe are at The View Garden twice because it was next to our hostel and reasonably priced. The food itself was good enough but the service is very slow but the ladies serving you are friendly. I had a Pina Colada up on the roof terrace, it tasted ok but the bar man had used milk so the drink curdled and separated and looked like gone off milk. \n\nThe roof terrace is lovely and the drinks are cheap so I'd recommend going but perhaps just have a beer!\nRead more\nWritten January 26, 2017",
