            "review_title": "Review at The View Garden",
            "review_text": "DSPSkanderborg\nSkanderborg, Denmark6 contributions\n0\nEverything is just perfect 👍\nJan 2017 • Couples\nWe are staying at the Duc Vuong hotel right now and breakfast at the View Garden is part af our package. We enjoy the buffet, all the different specialities, lots of delicious fruits and vegetables - things that we do not eat at breakfast in Denmark - and we love it!!\nWe had diner at The Rooftop Bar - fair prices, excellent meal and the most magnificent view over the city. It is as good as it gets !!!\nThe staff is so friendly, helpful, always smiling - just wonderful people, every one of them.\nWe look forward to returning again next week for another fantastic 5 days at the Duc Vuong hotel.\n\"We are family\" it says on the wall - exactly the way you make us feel. \nTorben and Dorte Pedersen\nDanmark\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 18, 2017",
