            "review_title": "Review at The View Garden",
            "review_text": "Martijn K\nBocholt, Belgium104 contributions\n0\nNice rooftoprestaurant\nDec 2016\nWe ate here two days before Christmas. When we came the rooftopbar was empty, but after diner there were a few other tables. Staff was friendly, but not all spook good English. \nWe had cocktails (2, 3rd free) and fish/meat on the barbecue. Nice food, cocktails were superb! Especially the strawberry mojito! \nWhen we had the bill, one item (tge meat on the bbc) was priced wrong, but they corrected it. \nConclusion: good price/quality!\nRead more\nWritten December 23, 2016",
