            "review_title": "Review at The View Garden",
            "review_text": "Sterling S\n59 contributions\n0\nDidn't get served and left\nDec 2016 • Couples\nTo be fair, it was a hot night and climbing the stairs to the roof garden had made me thirsty and a little short of patience.\nWe were seated and then abandoned for 10 minutes before we got your to leave in frustration. We were the only customers on the roof garden level (which had absolutely no views of the surrounding area) so needless to say I was a little disappointed.\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2016\nHotel D\nDear Sterling S,\nWe appreciate your taking the time to share your thoughts with us. We value all our guest feedback. Your feedback will certainly contribute towards the enhancement of our product and service for all future guest experience. \nHope to see you again at our restaurant during the rush hours, there would be more guests and people from all walks of life to be here. In a day time, most of our guests refer to stay in our air-condition room in a ground floor , 2nd and third floors, sorry not to let you know at the time you came. I have passed on your concerns to our staff to look into this further so that we can ensure that this does not happen again. \n Thank you Sterling S for your contribution and we hope to welcome you again to give you the better experience.\nKindly Regards\nThe View Garden\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
