            "review_text": "Anto198134\nMilan, Italy187 contributions\n0\nBeautiful view!\nNov 2016 • Couples\nThe view from the roof terrace is beautiful. Food is fine and price moderate for the district. Staff are nice. Beer is cheap and good.\nWritten December 9, 2016\nHotel D\nThank you for choosing The View Garden and give us your amazing review!\nIt is fabulous to read how much you enjoyed your dinning with us. The View Garden is a green garden away from the hustle and bustle of Bui Vien Street. I am happy that you find the food is fine with reasonable price. Our staff are always happy to know that you had a comfortable dinner with us.\nThank you once again and we do look forward to welcoming you back again\nKind regards,\nThe View Garden\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
