            "review_text": "Bánh T\n1 contribution\n0\nEverything is specail\nNov 2016 • Friends\nYesterday I came the view with my friends, they have seafood with the price very cheap. I'm and my friends just spent 500.000 for 3 carbs, octopus and snails. Food is amazing and the manager very professional, she take care me and aks me how about the food and then she invited me to visit the view garden - rooftop bar at the restaurant. I have a good time at The View and will come back at the next time. Tks you Serena and hope to see you again.\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2016\nHotel D\nThank you for choosing The View Garden for dinner and it was nice to meet you.\n\nSounds like you have had a great time with great dinner! I am glad to know that you have had a marvelous experience and good food. Our staff will be absolutely chuffed to read that she impacted your dinner so positively, thanks for mentioning her!\nYou are most welcome and we do look forward to welcoming you back again,\nKind regards,\nThe View Garden\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
